      <div class="svc"><a class="svc-link" href="/instagram-facebook-ads-for-beauty/"><span class="icw"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 11l16-6-4 14-5-4-3 3v-5z"/></svg></span><h3>Instagram &amp; Facebook Ads, Sharjah</h3><p>Modest, family-appropriate creative that respects Sharjah's decency norms and still shows off the work: hands, hair, brows and a calm ladies-only space.</p></a></div>
      <div class="svc"><a class="svc-link" href="/ai-appointment-booking-bot/"><span class="icw"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H4l2-3a8 8 0 1 1 15-5z"/></svg></span><h3>WhatsApp Booking Bot</h3><p>Replies in Arabic or English while the client is still stuck in E11 traffic, with prices and the next free slot, so she books before she gets home.</p></a><a class="rd" href="/salon-whatsapp-booking-leak/">Read: How evening WhatsApp leaks bookings →</a></div>
      <div class="svc"><a class="svc-link" href="/websites-landing-pages-for-beauty/"><span class="icw"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></span><h3>Bilingual Salon Websites</h3><p>Fast Arabic/English pages with visible "from" prices and package menus, because Sharjah clients compare before they call.</p></a><a class="rd" href="/salon-website-conversion-fixes/">Read: 7 fixes that make a site book →</a></div>
      <div class="svc"><a class="svc-link" href="/social-media-management-for-beauty/"><span class="icw"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l1.8 4.6L18 9l-4.2 1.4L12 15l-1.8-4.6L6 9l4.2-1.4z"/><path d="M18 15l.9 2.1L21 18l-2.1.9L18 21l-.9-2.1L15 18l2.1-.9z"/></svg></span><h3>Social Media for Ladies Salons</h3><p>Content calendars built around Ramadan, Eid, wedding season and back-to-school, the moments family clients plan their beauty visits around.</p></a><a class="rd" href="/salon-content-ideas-30-days/">Read: 30 days of salon post ideas →</a></div>
