				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-87c6e2c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="87c6e2c5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					
<div class="gwd" id="gwd-districts-v2-shj">
<section class="district-sec" id="districts">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="kicker" style="color:var(--lime)">Interactive · Sharjah neighbourhoods</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:14px;color:#fff">From the lagoon to the campuses: <span style="color:var(--lime)">five very different catchments</span></h2>
      <p class="sub" style="color:#A7A2B6;margin:14px auto 0">How we'd approach each area. These are qualitative notes from how we plan campaigns, not measured market data. Your audit checks your actual competitors and searches.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="district-tabs">
      <button class="dtab on" data-d="majaz">Al Majaz &amp; Buhaira</button>
      <button class="dtab" data-d="nahda">Al Nahda (Sharjah)</button>
      <button class="dtab" data-d="taawun">Al Taawun</button>
      <button class="dtab" data-d="khan">Al Khan</button>
      <button class="dtab" data-d="muwaileh">Muwaileh &amp; University City</button>
    </div>
    <div class="dpanel on" id="s2-majaz">
      <div><h3>Al Majaz &amp; the Buhaira Corniche</h3><p>Tower blocks around Al Majaz Waterfront and Khalid Lagoon, a short walk from Al Qasba. Plenty of established ladies salons and clinics share the same few streets, so a client choosing between them usually decides on photos, reviews and whether parking is easy.</p><div class="dtags"><span>Lagoon-side towers</span><span>Crowded salon streets</span><span>Evening walk-ins</span></div></div>
      <div class="dstats"><div class="dstat"><span>Typical demand (Glowth view)</span><b>Blow-dry, facials, threading</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Main hurdle</span><b>Standing out on Maps</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Channel we'd lead with</span><b>Maps profile + reviews</b></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpanel" id="s2-nahda">
      <div><h3>Al Nahda, Sharjah side</h3><p>This is the border. Dubai's Al Nahda and Al Qusais start across the road, so a resident searching "ladies salon near me" may see Dubai and Sharjah salons in the same map results. Clear prices, fast WhatsApp replies and a reason to stay on the Sharjah side do the work here.</p><div class="dtags"><span>Next to Dubai's Al Nahda</span><span>Mixed map results</span><span>Price comparison</span></div></div>
      <div class="dstats"><div class="dstat"><span>Typical demand (Glowth view)</span><b>Hair colour, nails, waxing</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Main hurdle</span><b>Dubai salons a few minutes away</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Channel we'd lead with</span><b>Google Ads + WhatsApp bot</b></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpanel" id="s2-taawun">
      <div><h3>Al Taawun</h3><p>High-rise family apartments around Expo Centre Sharjah and the Al Taawun corridor. Residents tend to stick with a salon in their own building or the next one along, so being the nearest well-reviewed option and running loyalty offers matters more than flashy launches.</p><div class="dtags"><span>Family towers</span><span>Building-by-building loyalty</span><span>Repeat bookings</span></div></div>
      <div class="dstats"><div class="dstat"><span>Typical demand (Glowth view)</span><b>Regular hair &amp; nail upkeep</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Main hurdle</span><b>Winning clients from the salon downstairs</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Channel we'd lead with</span><b>Local SEO + loyalty offers</b></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpanel" id="s2-khan">
      <div><h3>Al Khan</h3><p>A coastal neighbourhood beside Al Khan Lagoon and the Dubai boundary at Al Mamzar, with a growing number of residential towers. Newer buildings mean newer residents, many still looking for "their" salon, which makes this a good area to build a review lead early.</p><div class="dtags"><span>Coastal towers</span><span>New residents</span><span>Room to build reviews</span></div></div>
      <div class="dstats"><div class="dstat"><span>Typical demand (Glowth view)</span><b>Skincare facials, lashes, brows</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Main hurdle</span><b>Getting found before habits form</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Channel we'd lead with</span><b>Maps profile + Meta ads</b></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpanel" id="s2-muwaileh">
      <div><h3>Muwaileh &amp; University City</h3><p>University City is home to the University of Sharjah, the American University of Sharjah and other campuses, with Muwaileh's apartments and shops next door. Students and young families here respond to student offers, bundles and easy online booking more than to premium pricing.</p><div class="dtags"><span>Students &amp; young families</span><span>Offer-led</span><span>Mobile-first booking</span></div></div>
      <div class="dstats"><div class="dstat"><span>Typical demand (Glowth view)</span><b>Nails, brows, quick hair services</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Main hurdle</span><b>Price sensitivity</b></div><div class="dstat"><span>Channel we'd lead with</span><b>Instagram ads + online booking</b></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="dnote">District notes are Glowth's planning view, not survey or search-volume data.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
