				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7a8a084a elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="7a8a084a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					
<div class="gwd">
<section style="padding-top:0;background:#FBFAFE">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="kicker">The border problem on Google Maps</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:14px">When a Sharjah search <span class="hl">shows Dubai salons too</span></h2>
      <p class="sub">Near the Al Nahda and Al Khan boundaries, a "near me" search can mix salons from both emirates in one map box. Your profile has to give a Sharjah resident a reason to stay local: closer, open later, clearly ladies-only, honest prices. More in our guide to <a href="/salon-not-showing-google-maps/">why salons drop out of the map results</a>.</p>
